WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.980
I'm already up to level 10!

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:08.960
What about you people, still around level 3 or 4?

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.990
Starting around level 5, the abilities get more and more suited for battle!

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:14.590
Take a look...

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:17.500
The power at level 10 is wee-bit amazing...

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:22.900
Lil' Bomb!

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:31.810
So? Pretty awesome, right?

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:34.550
I can't wait until I hear the sound of me leveling up!

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.270
Leader, you've done well.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.660
Rest up today, and prepare for your showdown with the devil Craft.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:42.550
Showdown?

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.710
We're countin' on you, Leader.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.610
Presently, there are hundreds of alien species coming and going,

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:54.300
living their lives on Earth.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:58.360
But among the aliens are a large number of bad guys.

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:04.750
A group of courageous young men, chosen to be the chromatic warriors of justice,

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:08.710
the Color Rangers, are now on their way

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:11.000
Yamagata to face down the devil Craft!

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.010
Shut the hell up, Prince Dumbass!

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:23.760
The towns entrance is adorned with a cow's skull

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:28.720
It's fine that the law is decided by the strongest,

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:33.710
But this simple feeling will not be enough to fulfill you

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:39.190
Everyone will definitely revolt and shortly disappear

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:44.470
That's a shocking bloody picture

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:49.620
I'm feeling nauseous

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:59.830
Holding my head, I board the subway

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:10.270
Righteous way of living, righteous way of dying

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:20.720
Who on earth knows or what the hell can show me?

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.910
Cold finger girl

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.060
Sit Down

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.570
Damn, the cicadas are loud...

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:04.910
Even after headin' north, it's still friggin' hot.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.200
Well duh! We ain't at the North Pole, you know!

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:11.030
Come on, people! Try being a bit more on guard, would you?

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:13.270
We're now in enemy territory!

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:15.080
Who knows when they might attack?

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:27.760
Is that the devil Craft's secret base?

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:29.780
"Do-gu-ra".

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:32.640
Yup, gotta be the place.

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:38.370
On the side of the name plate, it looks like "Earth Defense" was written and then erased...

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:40.150
This seems kinda dangerous...

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.940
So that's the devil Craft?

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:51.160
Look at the build on that guy!

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.760
U-Um, would you be Craft-san?

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:57.080
That's my name... And?

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:58.760
Um, pardon us a bit.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:00.410
He looks strong!

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:02.320
Not a chance! Let's go home...

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:02.710
You idiot.

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:04.850
You idiot. This cost like, 10,000 in train fare!

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:06.020
We ain't goin' back just like this.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:08.390
It wasn't your money, Yokota!

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.610
Go, Leader.

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:13.830
Our fate rests on your shoulders, Leader.

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:16.600
Why am I the one that always has to do the dangerous stuff?

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:18.560
Stop stallin'!

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:19.480
Get out there and do it!

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:24.900
Uh... You see...

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:30.060
To be frank, we've come here to steal a key from you.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:30.620
A key?

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:34.200
N-N-N-No... I-I-I don't really mind one way or the other, see...

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.480
I'm fine staying like this!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.810
Even without the key, I'm all good.

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:40.340
Yeah man, it's <i>all</i> good.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.640
Akagawa's flipped out.

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:47.890
I don't exactly follow you, but I think I know what you mean by "key".

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:49.580
Anyway, come on inside.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:55.720
Ah... I see the situation quite clearly now.

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:59.480
But honestly, I can't believe he actually chose real elementary school kids.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:02.930
He looks like he's making some kind of painful decision...

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:07.260
I bet this guy's been put through a bunch of crap by that Prince, too.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:09.420
It's true that I hold a key.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.700
Then, give it to us!

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:14.990
However, I cannot hand it over.

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:19.070
Huh? Why not?

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:22.540
It is something very important I was instructed by the prince to protect.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:26.180
If you want the key, you will have to defeat me.

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:34.220
That idiot is listening to our conversation using those wristbands!

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:40.200
I'm not in a position to simply hand the key over to you, so play along with what I say, okay?

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.430
All-righty then!

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:47.190
If that's the way it's goin' down, then let's do this thing!

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:48.820
Don't underestimate us grade-school kids!

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.570
We totally do karate!

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:52.920
You little brats!

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:54.120
Come at me from all sides!

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:57.020
Kick to the back!

00:05:57.860 --> 00:05:59.660
Attacking from the rear? That's low!

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:02.880
Owww, you guys.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:04.160
That hurts.

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.290
It hurts.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:05.950
Definitely hurts.

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:07.030
Oh the pain.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:11.570
P-Please, take anything but the key!

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:18.510
Phew, I'm glad that devil Craft's

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:21.140
such an understanding guy.

00:06:21.140 --> 00:06:23.370
Lets take off these bands right away.

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:26.150
Yeah!

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:34.810
How do you use it?

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:38.190
You want me, your enemy, to help you?

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:40.160
Sorry, but I can't do that.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:45.490
I'm sorry, but I really don't know how to take the things off!

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.220
Yes? Hello?

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:02.930
Uh, Tachibana-sensei?

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.260
It's me, Shimizu.

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:07.750
Yeah. We got this key.

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:09.770
But we don't know how to use it.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:14.040
Ah... Actually I don't know how to use it either.

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:18.950
Plus, the suits were modified, so I bet the key was reconfigured, too.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:20.280
I see.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:21.760
Sorry.

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:25.120
Sensei says she doesn't know either.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:28.780
So coming all the way up to Yamagata was just a waste of time?

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:32.350
I doubt he ever intended to let us take them off.

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:35.570
I bet that prince would totally go that far to mess with us.

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:37.770
What're we gonna do?

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:47.520
Hell no!

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:50.500
Prince, are you listening!?

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.580
Oh, you're listening, all right!

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:55.010
And you're freakin' chuckling to yourself!

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:58.510
Listen up! I'm goin' with the kids now!

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:04.240
I'm gonna grab you by your neck and wring an apology out of ya!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.330
Colin, Sade! Return here at once!

00:08:06.890 --> 00:08:09.460
But we're in the middle of gathering horned beetles for our research...

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:10.370
I don't care!

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.520
We're going to put down the prince, now!

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:13.700
Put him down?

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:14.940
What, you can't?

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:16.210
Then, you're my enemy?

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:17.250
You're my enemy, right?

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:18.630
If you aren't, then come back now!

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:27.780
I wonder what I should do about the outfits?

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.470
You can remove them quite easily.

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:34.350
It's probably the same one my friend's child has.

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:36.910
Really?

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:37.880
How?

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:40.950
First, you rotate the round part on the rear end of the key.

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:42.530
When you do that,

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:44.710
the keyhole opens on the wristbands.

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:45.510
Ooh!

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:50.870
Then, the liquid on the tip takes the form of a key, and you stick that into the hole.

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.570
Oh, that's all?

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:53.490
When you do...

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.500
Say the password!

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:59.430
We don't know no password!

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:02.010
He must have input it himself!

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.760
There should be a password hint system in case you forget.

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:06.270
Hint?

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:11.260
Hint: The password is the name of the girl you like!

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:17.000
I like Itoi Rina.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.030
Oh, the girl in class 2?

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:21.070
But, she's got a boyfriend.

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:22.650
Yeah, well I still like her, 'kay?!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.440
Oh, yeah! It's off! I'm free!

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:27.120
Who's going next?

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.510
Mayuzumi, how about you?

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:29.760
Sure.

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:32.260
There don't appear to be any immediate booby-traps.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:34.190
Nobody in particular.

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:35.920
Okay.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:36.880
Next.

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:38.680
Too cool...

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.620
You're one hardcore bookworm.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:42.580
Here, you do it, Akagawa.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:45.970
N-No! I told you, I don't want to take it off.

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:49.320
What are you staring at me like that for?

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:53.050
It's not that I'm embarrassed to say the name of the girl I like or anything...

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:55.350
I'm really just fine staying like this.

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:56.400
Then, I'll go.

00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:59.320
But I've got a whole lot of them.

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:02.020
Let me see...

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:06.490
Natsumoto Sayaka, Sakurada Ayaka, Kojima Yuuko, Nakahori Kei,

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:10.960
Maeda Manami, Ogawa Erena, Kawakita Tomomi, Kuramochi Kyouka,

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.580
Komori Kana, Satou Fuyumi...

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:14.130
There's more.

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:18.800
Touno Rina, Nobi Kayo, Masubata Yuuka, Matsubara Natsuki...

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:22.640
Omoteno Kazumi, Tada Renka, Nishiyama Youka...

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.040
Yeah, I think that's it.

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:26.050
Password is insufficient!

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:27.980
What? No way!

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:29.410
Wait... Kanzawa Sae!

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:31.030
You are still missing one!

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:33.460
Uh... Who was it?

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:35.070
That girl from Higashi Nakano...

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:37.600
I can't believe he'd know about her...

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:39.100
Wow, what a dick.

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:41.980
Yokota, go ahead first.

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:44.460
Then, I'll do it over there...

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:45.660
What, man?

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:47.600
Come on, just say it here!

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:47.990
Shut up!

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:49.740
What? You embarrassed?

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:52.620
Embarrassed saying it in front of everyone?

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:58.450
Okay then.

00:10:58.450 --> 00:10:59.660
Bring it, punk.

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:04.170
We'll decide just who's the number-one fighting grade-schooler in all Japan, right here, right now!

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:08.780
What, would saying the name kill ya?!

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:10.250
Would it shatter your feelings?!

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:11.830
You think sayin' it'll jinx ya?!

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:13.300
Shut-up! It's a personal decision!

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.930
This is an order from your leader!

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:15.010
Stop fighting amongst yourselves!

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:16.630
You're just playing into the prince's hands!

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:21.770
Lil' Bomb! Lil' Bomb! Lil' Bomb! Lil' Bomb! Lil' Bomb! Lil' Bomb!

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:23.840
I said stop it, god damn it!

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:25.770
You're always fighting!

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:27.320
I've had enough!

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.990
The Red Ranger is definitely a hothead.

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:30.800
Yeah.

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:32.220
Let's call a cease-fire.

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:34.240
Take it off over there.

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:34.780
Right.

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:36.710
You guys are always...

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:37.600
Now, now.

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:38.830
Calm down, Akagawa.

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.670
I apologize about your garden.

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:46.490
It's okay. It's all that idiot's fault.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:53.470
Man, it's nice not having

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:54.630
anyone listening in on you!

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:57.880
I can finally take a crap without being self-conscious!

00:11:57.880 --> 00:12:00.480
Come on, Akagawa, won't you do it too?

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.890
How long are you gonna stay mad?

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:08.900
As soon as I remember that last name, I'll take off my wristband and you can have the key.

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:12.400
I told you, I don't want it.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.830
Suit yourself.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.000
Anyway,

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.410
with this, we're free of being that stupid prince's playthings.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.070
Yup!

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:22.570
And we all lived happily ever after.

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:24.410
All's well that ends well!

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:30.920
And thus, the 5 elementary school kids returned to their peaceful, everyday lives.

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:33.330
The Color Rangers' Chapter

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:33.330
The End

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:34.890
The Color Rangers' Chapter

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:34.890
The End

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.100
Psych.

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:41.780
That Itoi Rina from class 2... She sure is a cutie.

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:43.920
Plop.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:03.820
You, too?

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:06.230
Same for me.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:09.740
I just can't bring myself to throw it out.

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:10.730
Me, as well.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.760
I brought it with me for no apparent reason.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:14.820
Same as us?

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.780
Mornin'...

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:19.130
Mornin'!

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:21.200
Did you finally remember the rest of your password?

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:25.380
I can't remember the last girl, no matter what.

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:29.290
I mean, there's been so many girls I've met only once...

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:31.620
God damn, you're a prick.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.680
Good morning!

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:34.600
Guess who's level 15?!

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:37.570
I envy his happy-go-lucky attitude.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:45.310
Level 15 is totally awesome!

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:57.340
Where... are we?

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:00.490
We were in the classroom, right?

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:03.250
Hey, look at that!

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:08.140
The Color Rangers returned with the key safely,

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:10.620
but in the end it was, indeed, another of the Prince's traps!

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:17.630
When all five of the Color Rangers gather inside the classroom, a certain power was added to the key,

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:23.220
and they warped to the planet Calvary, 500 million light-years from the Earth!

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:25.720
What does he mean, "a certain power"?

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:29.720
Planet Calvary is like a garden of monsters!

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:34.790
Now, what will you do, my Color Rangers?

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:38.230
Demon Lord Quest?

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:40.490
And it's number 7...

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.300
Ah, I see.

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:44.470
This is RPG Creator.

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:45.740
W-What?

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:50.550
It's a tool that allows you to make your own RPGs.

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:51.470
I bet that Prince

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.300
has trapped us inside of something like that.

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:57.550
That is likely also why we were not able to throw away the wristbands.

00:14:57.550 --> 00:15:00.580
So, this is the world of an RPG?

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:06.330
Didn't the instruction manual say something about there not being any revive spell?

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:07.980
Crap...

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:10.060
If we're attacked by some monster, then...

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:18.900
Akagawa, transform!

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:21.040
Transform, transform!

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.400
Red Charge!

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:25.170
Lil' Bomb!

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:33.510
Yokota, what level are you?

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:35.500
Still level 1. How about you?

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:36.760
2.

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:41.330
Damn it... We need to find a town first.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.010
No objections here.

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:46.510
They really just disappeared!

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:49.040
I can't believe it!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:49.040
Everyone, quiet down!

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:51.020
Quiet down!

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:51.020
I bet they scrammed outta here at warp speed!

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:52.090
No!

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:54.200
They really disappeared!

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:57.930
<i>This is the prince's doing...</i>

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:02.540
<i>I figured those five would be okay, but now I'm a little worried.</i>

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:06.200
My desk split in half!

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:07.420
Okay.

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:09.770
I'm taking attendance now.

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:14.430
In the vastness of the universe lay planets

00:16:14.430 --> 00:16:18.790
completely constructed as full-blown RPGs for one's amusement.

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:27.390
And, 500 light-years away from the Earth, the planet Calvary is one of these RPG planets.

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:30.180
Welcome to Tarsting Town!

00:16:30.890 --> 00:16:34.490
Um, could you give us some hint about a quest or something?

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:36.690
Welcome to Tarsting Town!

