She's scary...

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:52.360
She's scary...

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:52.360
There, there.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.700
That's all she's been programmed to say, that's all.

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:58.570
RPG's ain't something you're supposed to do for real.

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:01.540
This is freaking me out.

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:07.150
I bet they just keep walking around randomly until we try and talk to them.

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:12.580
Hey. There's an old fart that's been followin' us this whole time.

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:19.590
Um... Do you need something?

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:24.650
If you head south two kilometers from this town, you'll find a castle.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:28.800
Lately, the King who lives in that castle has not been feeling very well.

00:17:29.530 --> 00:17:31.510
I wonder what might be the matter?

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:36.600
Looks like we set up a flag in the game.

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:39.540
This should trigger some kind of event.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:44.550
Like that?

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:56.520
The Dragon Knights who serve directly under the Demon Lord are flying towards the castle.

00:17:57.020 --> 00:18:03.010
Perhaps this has something to do with the King not feeling well lately.

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:09.780
So basically... "Head to the castle."

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:12.530
Are we gonna have to fight with that thing?

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:16.290
It doesn't look like an opponent we can beat at our current level.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:19.310
Who wants to head straight to the castle?

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:24.350
Who thinks we should go after everyone's at least level 10?

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:26.760
Okay, level 20?

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:31.460
Then, people who want to wait until level 30 or more?

