00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:21.550
Worrying about my students like this...

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:24.630
I'm really becoming a teacher at heart.

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:28.930
you need that courage, that love!

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:30.540
Maybe I'll give up being an assassin and stay on this planet as a teacher forever...

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:36.060
